  "limitations": [
    "Complete video billing and asynchronous required settlement remain open. No paid video inference or invoice qualification occurred.",
    "Global live-provider gates fail outside DeepInfra. Drift reports missing acquisition credentials and stale DeepSeek, Cerebras, and Groq fixtures. DeepInfra succeeds.",
    "FastVideo is absent from current acquisition. Its retained unit correction follows historical commit 0414a3cd1, not current availability evidence. The inspected current API URL returns 404.",
    "The first producer race run failed six tests: unstaged catalog bytes failed the index comparison; earlier billing additions lacked census and OCR identity/capability updates; a page ceiling was required without supporting facts.",
    "The corrected OCR test retains page-rate and endpoint assertions. Fixed-page requests require positive decoded page counts and enforce known limits. Unknown provider page ceilings are not invented.",
